# Agent Mode

Read `.cursor/agent-mode.json` (missing ⇒ `balanced`). Inject **one** line from `scripts/lib/agent_mode.py` `INJECTION` for the current mode.

While `lean`: refuse Cloud Agents and Grok Bots; say `REFUSED` and point to `/speed` or `/balanced`. Prefer LOCAL sequential and brief replies.
